## Features
- Festive Gingerbread House Design;
- Animated Rotating Train & Warm LEDs;
- 8 Classic Christmas Tunes;
- Battery Powered with Non-Slip Base;
- Hand-Painted Polyresin Craftsmanship;

## Information
Capture the holiday spirit with this hand-painted gingerbread house decoration, finished with snow details. Illuminated by warm white LEDs, it features an animated train rotating around the base and plays 8 classic Christmas melodies. The switch allows you choose between lights with music or lights only. Powered by batteries for cordless placement, it includes a non-slip base to protect tabletop surfaces while bringing nostalgic festive cheer to your mantel or entryway.
